          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വോട്ട് ചെയ്യുക — vōṭṭŭ ceyyuka — \"to vote\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഞാൻ ഇന്നലെ ആദ്യമായി വോട്ട് ചെയ്തു. ñān innale ādyamāyi vōṭṭŭ ceytu. Yesterday I voted for the first time."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: വോട്ട് ചെയ്തു, vōṭṭŭ ceytu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "For someone: -ന് വോട്ട് ചെയ്യുക (vōṭṭŭ ceyyuka)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വോട്ട് ചെയ്യുക (vōṭṭŭ ceyyuka) is a phrase verb built on വോട്ട്, which was borrowed from English vote, with ചെയ്യുക, \"to do\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
