              "text": "പിന്തുണയ്ക്കുക (pintuṇaykkuka) is native Dravidian, the verb of പിന്തുണ: പിൻ, \"behind\" (DEDR 4205), and തുണ, \"help\" (DEDR 3308), whose verb tuṇekka, \"to help\", DEDR also lists."
